// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Dedicated per-lesson verification quizzes — the "Verify" step for Learning
// Pathway lessons that don't have a good topical match in the existing
// bioBiochem/chemPhys/psychSoc category banks (mostly career-guidance and
// applied-skill lessons: shadowing, volunteering, admissions info, research
// literacy, public speaking, teamwork). Where a lesson's topic already has a
// strong match in the existing bank (e.g. "DNA Replication" -> bb28), that
// lesson is wired directly to the existing quiz id in constants.js instead of
// duplicating content here — see the quizIds assigned per lesson there.
//
// Several ids here are intentionally shared across multiple lessons/pathways
// (e.g. `shadow101q` for every "Shadowing & Clinical Exposure 101" lesson) —
// the underlying skill/guidance is genuinely identical regardless of which
// health career the student is tracking toward.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

